<title>MEXICO: Mexico's GFesa seeking minority partner.</title>
<headline>Mexico's GFesa seeking minority partner.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican book publisher Grupo Fernandez Editores S.A. de C.V., also known as GFesa, said Wednesday it had signed a letter of intent with Bankers Trust New York Corp to search for a minority partner.</p>
<p>GFesa said it was seeking a partner to invest more than $10 million over about three months.</p>
<p>&quot;The objective is capitalization...it would be to strengthen the financial structure of GFesa and consolidate its growth through the continuing process of increasing its presence in foreign and international markets,&quot; GFesa said.</p>
<p>-- Karina Balderas, Mexico City Newsroom (525) 728-9562</p>
